# Task planning artifacts (kept local; not published) — except the design narrative
# and the research doc actually used, which are published as project rationale/research.
docs/task-artifacts/*
!docs/task-artifacts/03-design-discussion.md
!docs/task-artifacts/02-research.md
# The iteration-2 implementation log IS the committed run record the paper cites, and the file
# both machines (Diana / Ian) append their run records to — it must be tracked.
!docs/task-artifacts/iteration-2-implementation-log.md

